* ADG711 Analog Switch Test
.lib ADG711.sub

* Power Supply (Single 5V supply)
V_VDD VDD 0 5V

* Analog Input Signal
V_IN IN 0 2V

* Control Signal (Logic 0 closes the switch for ADG711)
V_CTRL CTRL 0 0V

* Load Resistor
R_LOAD OUT 0 10k

* ADG711 Quad SPST Switch Instantiation
* Standard 16-pin DIP/SOIC/TSSOP Pinout:
* 1:IN1  2:D1  3:S1  4:VSS  5:GND  6:S4  7:D4  8:IN4 
* 9:IN3 10:D3 11:S3 12:NC  13:VDD 14:S2 15:D2 16:IN2
* Unused switches (2, 3, 4) and NC are safely grounded.
X1 CTRL OUT IN 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 VDD 0 0 0 ADG711

* Analysis Directive
.tran 1m

.end
